WEBVTT

1
00:00.500 --> 00:06.590
This is OpenWhispr Dictation, private voice typing
for Windows that runs entirely on your own computer,

2
00:06.640 --> 00:10.450
and I’m Maeve. I read the replies back to you.

3
00:11.780 --> 00:13.710
Hold your hotkey and talk.

4
00:14.120 --> 00:16.150
Parakeet transcribes on your own processor,

5
00:16.200 --> 00:19.130
and a live preview shows the words as you speak.

6
00:20.420 --> 00:24.110
Let go, and a local Gemma model tidies it up.

7
00:24.220 --> 00:25.810
Fillers and stutters disappear,

8
00:25.860 --> 00:29.250
and punctuation and your project names come out right.

9
00:29.560 --> 00:31.970
Short lines skip the model completely.

10
00:33.400 --> 00:35.730
The clean text lands right at your cursor

11
00:35.780 --> 00:38.310
about two seconds after you stop talking.
